The simple answer is to use tasks: #pragma omp parallel
#pragma omp single
{
// split the array
#pragma omp task
// recursive call first half
#pragma omp task
// recursive call second half
} This will work fine but will not be efficient. it will keep generating tasks, even for very small arrays. This can be fixed. Splitting the array is now not parallel. You can do this with a prefix operation, but this is much harder.

